internet-gateway gru-1-api-igw: enabled in the cell VCN
route-table gru-1-api-routes: 0.0.0.0/0 to gru-1-api-igw
security-list gru-1-api-security: no ingress; egress tcp/9465 and tcp/8080 to 10.251.0.0/25
subnet gru-1-api-subnet: 10.251.0.128/26, gru-1-api-routes, gru-1-api-security
network-security-group gru-1-api-nsg: tcp/80 and tcp/443 from each Cloudflare IPv4 range only (public-api origin-ips)
nsg-rule workload NSG: tcp/9465 from 10.251.0.128/26 (load balancer to TerraBase)
nsg-rule controller NSG: tcp/8080 from 10.251.0.128/26 (load balancer to ts-auth)
vault-secret gru-1-api-origin: Cloudflare Origin CA certificate and RSA key for gru.api.terrascale.tech and gru.auth.terrascale.tech, 5475 days (public-api cert)
load-balancer gru-1-api: public, flexible 10-100 Mbps, NSG gru-1-api-nsg, idle timeout 120s
listener https gru.api.terrascale.tech: :443, Origin CA certificate, requires the customer origin-pull client certificate, to backend set terrabase
listener https gru.auth.terrascale.tech: :443, Origin CA certificate, requires the customer origin-pull client certificate, to backend set ts-auth
listener http: :80, 301 to https
backend-set terrabase: seeded with gru-1-db-1 10.251.0.21:9465, then owned by the controller (freeform ownership GRU/lb-backends/public-terrabase for ts-470-gru-rebuild-2), TLS verified against the member CA, GET /readyz
backend-set ts-auth: gru-1-ctl-1 10.251.0.11:8080, gru-1-ctl-2 10.251.0.12:8080, gru-1-ctl-3 10.251.0.13:8080, GET /readyz
cloudflare: SSL Full (strict) for gru.api.terrascale.tech and gru.auth.terrascale.tech, custom zone Authenticated Origin Pulls on; requires public_api.origin_pull CA and certificate ID (oci-region dns)
dns-record gru.api.terrascale.tech: A to the gru-1-api public IP, proxied (oci-region dns)
dns-record gru.auth.terrascale.tech: A to the gru-1-api public IP, proxied (oci-region dns)
